  "full_text": "So I have new respect for the game of golf. So apparently it's all about keeping grace. I was just wondering about jogging. I don't really like vanity exercise. Maybe golf is bad. Vanity exercise is bad. So I have to shave every day. That's my golf game. I don't believe in vanity exercise. I just happen to run, right? So you can see the, so why would I run? It's vanity exercise. But now I just started thinking about running, not trying to get control of your muscles so that you run efficiently. So you can feel when you're running efficiently. Anyway.",
